|                                                              |                                                            | GraalVM
*--------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------+
| {{{./springboot/SpringRestCatsHttpServer/index.html}Cats Effect}} | Integrate Cats Effect functional IO into OfficeFloor REST composition. | {{{https://typelevel.org/cats-effect/}Cats Effect}}
*--------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------+
